      "offsetInSection": 7804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 43,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "スシ＆コーヒーが<U+0010><U+0007>！<U+0001><U+0003>新あたら新しい<U+0010><U+0008>！<U+0002><U+0003>世界せかい世界を<U+0010><U+0006>！<U+0001><U+0002>開ひら開く！\nあなたもカフェ・カンコドールにゴー<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǟ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 67,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
